          <div style="margin-top:10px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:oklch(0.72 0.02 85);text-wrap:pretty">4 years of leadership in one of the nation's most ambitious high school rocketry teams, with custom PCBs, functional Airbrakes, and dead accurate software to drive it.</div>
