          <div style="margin-top:10px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:oklch(0.72 0.02 85);text-wrap:pretty">Mechanical and design subdivision lead for FRC team South Bay Robotics during the 2024 “Crescendo” season.</div>
          <div style="margin-top:16px;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.1em;color:oklch(0.45 0.02 85);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px"><span>DRWN. IH</span><span>SCALE 1:1</span><span>006-A</span></div>
