          <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;color:oklch(0.5 0.02 85)"><span>007</span><span>SOFTWARE</span></div>
          <img src="assets/proj-kicad-autoplacer.png" alt="KiCad Autoplacer constraint window beside a board in the PCB editor" style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/10;margin-top:16px;border-radius:4px;object-fit:cover;object-position:right center;background:oklch(0.2 0.02 250)">
          <div style="margin-top:20px;font-size:21px;font-weight:500;text-wrap:pretty">KiCad Autoplacer</div>
          <div style="margin-top:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px">
            <div style="width:1px;height:5px;background:oklch(0.5 0.03 250 / 0.6)"></div>
            <div style="width:36px;height:1px;background:oklch(0.5 0.03 250 / 0.6)"></div>
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top:10px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:oklch(0.72 0.02 85);text-wrap:pretty">Automatic component placement for KiCad 9/10. Set constraints in a window like which parts belong together, which must touch the board edge, and which must not move. It then places the board for you.</div>
          <a href="https://github.com/ivarhak/Kicad-Autoplacer" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="margin-top:14px;display:inline-block;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.08em;color:oklch(0.58 0.14 250);border-bottom:1px solid oklch(0.4 0.03 250 / 0.5)" style-hover="border-color:oklch(0.5 0.14 250)">VIEW ON GITHUB ↗</a>
          <div style="margin-top:16px;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.1em;color:oklch(0.45 0.02 85);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px"><span>DRWN. IH</span><span>SCALE 1:1</span><span>007-A</span></div>
        </div>
        <div data-stagger="1" style="position:relative;background:oklch(0.14 0.015 250);padding:36px;opacity:0;transform:translateY(32px);transition:background 0.3s ease,opacity 0.6s ease,transform 0.6s ease" style-hover="background:oklch(0.17 0.02 250)">
          <div style="position:absolute;top:6px;left:6px;width:8px;height:8px;border-top:1px solid oklch(0.5 0.03 250 / 0.6);border-left:1px solid oklch(0.5 0.03 250 / 0.6)"></div>
          <div style="position:absolute;bottom:6px;right:6px;width:8px;height:8px;border-bottom:1px solid oklch(0.5 0.03 250 / 0.6);border-right:1px solid oklch(0.5 0.03 250 / 0.6)"></div>
          <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;color:oklch(0.5 0.02 85)"><span>008</span><span>TARC</span></div>
          <img src="assets/proj-bmp581.png" alt="Compact BMP581 breakout board render" style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/10;margin-top:16px;border-radius:4px;object-fit:cover;background:oklch(0.2 0.02 250)">
          <div style="margin-top:20px;font-size:21px;font-weight:500;text-wrap:pretty">Compact BMP581 Breakout</div>
          <div style="margin-top:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px">
            <div style="width:1px;height:5px;background:oklch(0.5 0.03 250 / 0.6)"></div>
